[8.96,"o","     Read with                 Cost a year, this repo   Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[9.02,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway   ≈ $0.11                  the best option\r\n"]
[9.08,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.16                  ≈ 3% less precise labels\r\n"]
[9.14,"o","  3  Anthropic                 ≈ $0.23                  ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[9.2,"o","  4  Not now                   free                     ≈ 27% of its changes in new releases\r\n"]
[9.26,"o","     Jev: a labelling service, used beside the provider that reads the notes.\r\n"]
